==Battleground==
*4 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'mammoth]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ice Doge]]s spawn, delay 30~50 seconds<sup>900f~1,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Because this stage relies almost entirely on [[Wave Attack]] for damage, bringing a [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] is absolutely mandatory or else your backliners will not stand a chance. Nearly any Wave Shield up to and including [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] will work, as long as their range is short and can be stacked.

